description = "Engineered articulation points — the frame itself bends through complex geometry. Not weak joints; designed ones. The suit bends with the path rather than fighting it, which makes 3D maneuvering feel direct. The articulation adds acoustic signature: moving quietly in a Flex Frame is technique, not default."
